   "lines": [
    "Am leading the",
    "most intensely happy",
    "& healthy, out of doors",
    "life. I spending",
    "my time riding",
    "on horseback,",
    "making long",
    "tramps through",
    "woods and fields",
    "after specimens,",
    "or else on the",
    "bay, rowing or",
    "sailing — generally",
    "in a half naked",
    "condition and",
    "with my gun",
    "along. I could",
    "not be happier,"
   ],
